OL,3,ARussia launches largest attack on
OL,4,AUkraine energy infrastructure since
OL,5,Aspring
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussia has launched the largest attack
OL,8,Fon Ukraine's energy infrastructure
OL,9,Fsince the spring, primarily targeting
OL,10,FKyiv and the surrounding region,
OL,11,FUkrainian Prime Minister Serhiy
OL,12,FKoretskyi has said.
OL,14,FAt least six people were killed and 33
OL,15,Fothers injured across the country in
OL,16,Fthe overnight attacks, including a
OL,17,Fchild in the Kyiv region, local
OL,18,Fauthorities reported.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
